rong> PARTS</strong>\u00a0to build own\u00a0<i><strong>SPACESHIPS</strong></i>... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1956850/extras/4e346f0706f3829f16449daa755f5738.webp?t=1744710165\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1956850/extras/240a90016111cbecb6703aa5494ebae8.poster.avif?t=1744710165\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1956850/extras/240a90016111cbecb6703aa5494ebae8.webm?t=1744710165\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div>Reclaim implants to <strong>unlock new ABILITIES</strong> or get protection by<strong>  your SHIELD</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1956850/extras/3d4f297c8490cfe665f40362e697cce0.webp?t=1744710165\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1956850/extras/207fb1eb8fc37a9d3b014de18d189576.poster.avif?t=1744710165\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1956850/extras/207fb1eb8fc37a9d3b014de18d189576.webm?t=1744710165\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div>Need a brake from destroying Aldions? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Just launch your spaceship and discover galaxies noone has been before...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>ABOUT PROJECT MIND:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The scientific project develops implants which improve your mind in certain aspects. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The aldions consider this project a unnatural, dangerous venture and try everything to cancle it. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">That\u2019s why they infiltrate the spaceship of project mind and steal all data and implants necessary to keep the project alive...</p>",
